WEBVTT

00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:11.400
"Kodomo no Odocha"

00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:13.740
That rumor that I love you

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:17.370
is true, yes it is.

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:20.870
You can't ignore it either.

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:25.460
Whether you're awake or asleep,

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:29.090
please don't be embarrassed.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:36.680
Is it a sin if I sneak into your heart

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:40.350
by ridding you...

00:00:41.390 --> 00:00:43.520
...of your other love?

00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:48.110
At sunset,

00:00:48.730 --> 00:00:50.610
when the children go home,

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:54.570
Today's incident is burning love!

00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:58.450
You can tell it accurately.

00:00:58.740 --> 00:01:00.540
7 O'Clock News!

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:04.330
Please, our relationship...

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:09.960
Please don't blame it on the true kiss

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:11.800
In a city without light,

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:15.680
let's burn the fire of love.

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:19.100
Don't be so easy going

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:21.390
The existence is a mistake

00:01:21.760 --> 00:01:24.890
You're asking for something not there.

00:01:32.280 --> 00:01:35.610
I'm Kurata Sana, a 6th grader
and TV personality.

00:01:35.610 --> 00:01:37.610
My novelist Mama.

00:01:37.610 --> 00:01:39.620
My manager, Rei-kun.

00:01:39.620 --> 00:01:42.290
Hayama, who hasn't appeared much lately.

00:01:42.290 --> 00:01:43.290
And here's Babbit.

00:01:43.290 --> 00:01:45.160
The introductions today are quick.

00:01:46.620 --> 00:01:49.290
"A Singing Heart Goes 3,2,1"

00:01:50.710 --> 00:01:52.380
"Shorokutai"?

00:01:52.380 --> 00:01:53.050
"Shorokutai ('Youth-six-squad')"

00:01:53.050 --> 00:01:56.340
That's right. There's Ayanohanamarukoji
Tomomi-chan, right?

00:01:56.340 --> 00:01:57.380
There's Tobita Mayu-chan, right?

00:01:57.380 --> 00:01:59.050
Then there's you, Sana-chan.

00:01:59.050 --> 00:02:04.060
You're a trio of 6th grade girl idols
at the height of popularity,

00:02:04.390 --> 00:02:05.730
so you're Shorokutai!

00:02:05.730 --> 00:02:08.060
What poor sense in naming.

00:02:08.060 --> 00:02:10.060
Ayanohanamarukoji Tomomi-chan
is that pretty girl

00:02:10.060 --> 00:02:12.400
who appears in the
tea commercials, right?

00:02:12.400 --> 00:02:14.070
"Ayanohanamarukoji Tomomi"

00:02:12.400 --> 00:02:14.070
It's delicious.

00:02:14.070 --> 00:02:15.070
Right, right.

00:02:15.070 --> 00:02:17.320
Tobita Mayu-chan is
the one who sings hits,

00:02:17.320 --> 00:02:18.740
and is the popular lead actress
in those dramas.

00:02:18.740 --> 00:02:20.030
The big idol- that Tobita Mayu-chan?

00:02:19.740 --> 00:02:22.370
"Tobita Mayu"

00:02:20.070 --> 00:02:22.410
Right, right.

00:02:22.410 --> 00:02:24.580
Mayu-chan is so cool!
Her dancing, and singing,

00:02:24.580 --> 00:02:27.080
and acting in dramas is all so good.

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:29.750
Well, they're planning
a 90-minute special,

00:02:29.750 --> 00:02:31.330
so it's a match-up
that would only happen once,

00:02:31.330 --> 00:02:34.340
but it will be structured to have drama,
and singing, and dancing!

00:02:34.340 --> 00:02:36.670
They say they're even going to write
a song just for Shorokutai to perform!

00:02:36.670 --> 00:02:38.340
That does sound interesting.

00:02:38.340 --> 00:02:39.550
Doesn't it? Doesn't it?

00:02:39.550 --> 00:02:41.010
--So, you'll accept the job, right?
--By any chance,

00:02:41.010 --> 00:02:43.680
--You accept it?
--have you already accepted it?

00:02:43.680 --> 00:02:44.350
Uh-huh.

00:02:44.350 --> 00:02:46.350
Suji-san, isn't it missing something?

00:02:46.350 --> 00:02:47.350
How so?

00:02:47.350 --> 00:02:49.350
Let's put all sorts of things in there!
See? It's more lively this way!

00:02:49.350 --> 00:02:50.690
--Okay, I'm off to go shoot
--I worked meticulously

00:02:50.690 --> 00:02:52.690
--"Nonchalant Zenjiro"!
--for four hours on her.

00:02:52.690 --> 00:02:55.690
What about the job?

00:02:55.690 --> 00:02:59.360
It's okay! Sana-chan
will be sure to do it.

00:02:59.360 --> 00:03:01.360
Still, about that Shorokutai name...

00:03:01.360 --> 00:03:04.030
Huh? You birthday is coming,
Zenjiro-san?

00:03:04.030 --> 00:03:07.040
That's right,
the last Sunday of the month.

00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:08.370
Congratulations!

00:03:08.370 --> 00:03:13.380
Ow! Thanks. Still, nobody is
gonna celebrate it with me.

00:03:13.710 --> 00:03:15.380
What about Saori-chan,
the ad campaign girl?

00:03:15.380 --> 00:03:18.720
Shh! Not so loud! We're having
a little trouble, you see...

00:03:18.720 --> 00:03:21.720
She found out he was dating someone else.

00:03:21.720 --> 00:03:23.050
Yes, she did.

00:03:23.050 --> 00:03:26.390
Ah, you're not supposed to say that!

00:03:26.390 --> 00:03:31.020
Zenjiro... lonely birthday...

00:03:31.980 --> 00:03:34.650
How about we throw a birthday
party for Zenjiro-sensei?

00:03:34.650 --> 00:03:37.070
Wow! You mean it!? I can't believe it!

00:03:37.070 --> 00:03:39.030
And I nevuh even said
a woid about wanting one!

00:03:39.030 --> 00:03:41.700
Lucky! Happy! Ka-ching!

00:03:41.700 --> 00:03:45.370
Happy birthday, Zenjiro!

00:03:45.370 --> 00:03:48.700
He really is a lonely man.

00:03:48.700 --> 00:03:52.000
Let me just say, we're only
talking about within the anime!

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:55.040
You are the elduhly boss
of Kodocha Inn here, right?

00:03:55.040 --> 00:03:56.340
We are travelers.

00:03:56.340 --> 00:03:57.340
Let us stay here.

00:03:57.340 --> 00:03:59.050
Sure, as long as it's only one night.

00:03:59.050 --> 00:04:01.970
--Zenjiro-chan, that wasn't funny enough.
Do it one more time.
--This is taking a long time.

00:04:01.970 --> 00:04:04.930
--It's time for our first Shorokutai meeting.
--You want me to make it funniuh?

00:04:06.050 --> 00:04:09.060
This week's Sana-chan!

00:04:13.060 --> 00:04:15.060
She's got a different
way of making an entrance!

00:04:15.060 --> 00:04:18.360
We are one hour late. That's the
perfect time, isn't it, Mayu-chan?

00:04:18.360 --> 00:04:19.360
Yes, Mama.

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:21.740
You good boys and girls, be on time!

00:04:21.740 --> 00:04:24.410
Mayu-chan, don't let yourself
be outdone by the other two.

00:04:24.410 --> 00:04:26.700
You're the one with the ability
and the talent, after all.

00:04:26.740 --> 00:04:29.080
We're going to distance you
ahead of the others as best we can.

00:04:29.080 --> 00:04:30.410
Right, Mama.

00:04:30.410 --> 00:04:32.000
Everyone else must be waiting for me.

00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:35.670
Unless I'm here, they can't start
making arrangements, or anything else.

00:04:35.670 --> 00:04:38.880
Shorokutai, huh? Hmm...

00:04:35.790 --> 00:04:39.750
"Shorokutai Special Room"

00:04:40.340 --> 00:04:42.010
Mayu-chan!

00:04:42.010 --> 00:04:45.680
Sorry I'm late, everyone.
I'm Tobita Mayu.

00:04:45.680 --> 00:04:49.010
Nice to meet you.
I'm Ayanohanamarukoji Tomomi.

00:04:49.010 --> 00:04:51.020
Ah, and I am her manager, Ha.

00:04:51.020 --> 00:04:54.690
Mayu-san, pleased to
make your acquaintance.

00:04:54.690 --> 00:04:56.690
It's a pleasure.

00:04:56.690 --> 00:05:00.690
Tomomi won't make any difference.
She's no different from being a doll.

00:05:00.690 --> 00:05:03.360
Never mind her, what concerns me is...

00:05:03.360 --> 00:05:06.700
Well, now we're just
waiting for Sana-chan.

00:05:06.700 --> 00:05:08.370
Yes, that's right.

00:05:08.370 --> 00:05:11.040
Kurata-san is not here yet!?

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:13.370
Shooting on "Child's Toy"
appears to have run long.

00:05:13.370 --> 00:05:17.040
What? She's coming later than me?

00:05:17.040 --> 00:05:20.380
Sana-chan! Run at full speed!
We're a whole hour late!

00:05:20.380 --> 00:05:23.050
Shoot! It's wrong
to keep everyone waiting!

00:05:23.050 --> 00:05:25.380
All right, at times like this!

00:05:25.380 --> 00:05:28.390
Sana-chan, how do you do that!?

00:05:28.390 --> 00:05:30.720
Rei-kun, hurry!

00:05:30.720 --> 00:05:32.970
Er, look out!

00:05:32.970 --> 00:05:35.180
Sorry I'm so terribly late!

00:05:36.310 --> 00:05:38.440
Kurata Sana, age 11!

00:05:41.650 --> 00:05:45.650
Ah, Tomomi-chan?
You're Tomomi-chan, right? Hello.

00:05:45.650 --> 00:05:47.990
Nice to meet you.

00:05:47.990 --> 00:05:49.320
What? What is it?

00:05:49.320 --> 00:05:50.990
It's just... your hair...

00:05:50.990 --> 00:05:54.660
Oh, I didn't have time to fix it.
Here, as a token of our friendship.

00:05:54.660 --> 00:05:57.000
What is she going to do with that?

00:05:57.000 --> 00:05:58.000
Oh, whoops.

00:05:58.000 --> 00:05:59.330
Sorry about this, Mayu-chan.

00:05:59.330 --> 00:06:01.340
I'll put together a knife
and fork set especially for you.

00:06:01.340 --> 00:06:03.340
That won't do it.

00:06:03.340 --> 00:06:07.130
I'm Tsu, the producer. Now that all
of our members have come together,

00:06:07.130 --> 00:06:09.340
we'd like to get started.

00:06:09.340 --> 00:06:13.350
Yes, let's. Mayu has other things
scheduled after this.

00:06:13.350 --> 00:06:15.680
Sagami Rei! Very sorry I'm late!

00:06:15.680 --> 00:06:20.020
Shorokutai, Shorokutai,
Hyorokutai, Hyorokudama ("simpleton")?

00:06:20.020 --> 00:06:21.690
It's lame, all right.

00:06:21.690 --> 00:06:26.690
Will I be playing the heroine during
the drama part of this special?

00:06:26.690 --> 00:06:29.030
--In that case, I would like
Kamura Naozumi-san to be my co-star.
--There's going to be a drama part, too?

00:06:29.030 --> 00:06:30.700
--In that case, I would like
Kamura Naozumi-san to be my co-star.
--I told you that before, didn't I?

00:06:30.700 --> 00:06:33.990
Uh, well, I was going to get to that...

00:06:33.990 --> 00:06:39.000
And about this new song for Shorokutai,
please allow me to sing the lead vocals.

00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:40.330
--If you like, I could
compose something as well.
--There's going to be a song, too?

00:06:40.330 --> 00:06:41.670
--If you like, I could
compose something as well.
--I told you that before, didn't I?

00:06:41.670 --> 00:06:45.340
No, we have a composer here already.

00:06:45.340 --> 00:06:46.010
That's me.

00:06:46.010 --> 00:06:49.800
Anyhow, I'd like to proceed with casting
the heroine for the drama corner,

00:06:49.800 --> 00:06:51.680
and the parts for the song-

00:06:51.680 --> 00:06:56.680
If Mayu's requests are not met, she may
decide to withdraw from these discussions.

00:06:57.020 --> 00:07:00.020
And I was so excited about this, too.
What a shame.

00:07:00.020 --> 00:07:03.360
Uh, well, we'll see
what we can do about that-

00:07:03.360 --> 00:07:05.020
That is what she would like.

00:07:05.020 --> 00:07:07.360
Will I have any work to do?

00:07:07.360 --> 00:07:09.030
And another thing...

00:07:09.030 --> 00:07:10.360
What would that be?

00:07:10.360 --> 00:07:13.700
Who was it that came up
with the naming "Shorokutai"?

00:07:13.700 --> 00:07:15.030
That would be me.

00:07:15.030 --> 00:07:18.290
That was some nice naming.
You've got a good sense for it.

00:07:21.040 --> 00:07:23.380
Zenjiro-san's birthday party?

00:07:23.380 --> 00:07:26.090
Mm-hmm! We're having it at my place!
I want to do it on a large scale.

00:07:26.090 --> 00:07:27.050
Everyone, come!

00:07:27.050 --> 00:07:29.720
Zenjiro-san, huh?
He's not really my type.

00:07:29.720 --> 00:07:31.630
He seems a little lewd.

00:07:31.630 --> 00:07:32.970
He's got weird sideburns.

00:07:32.970 --> 00:07:34.640
And he's skinny.

00:07:34.640 --> 00:07:37.140
Sounds like they're saying
awl sorts of stuff about me.

00:07:37.140 --> 00:07:38.980
Don't I have any popularity,
even with goils?

00:07:38.980 --> 00:07:40.640
Then, you won't come?

00:07:40.640 --> 00:07:42.650
--Uh-uh, we'll go!

00:07:42.650 --> 00:07:44.310
Ah, thank goodness!

00:07:44.310 --> 00:07:45.980
What should we do for presents?

00:07:45.980 --> 00:07:47.320
Presents, huh?

00:07:47.320 --> 00:07:50.320
How about if we all
make handmade presents?

00:07:50.320 --> 00:07:51.650
Ah, that might be good!

00:07:51.650 --> 00:07:52.990
Well then, that's settled.

00:07:52.990 --> 00:07:56.240
Hmm, handmade, huh? I get the feeling
I'm not too good

00:07:56.240 --> 00:07:59.000
at something girly like that.
Oh well.

00:07:59.000 --> 00:08:01.000
Hey, will you guys come, too?

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:02.330
Are you sure? Are you sure?

00:08:02.330 --> 00:08:03.330
Of course!

00:08:03.330 --> 00:08:04.330
Hey, what about you, Hayama?

00:08:04.330 --> 00:08:05.670
Akito-kun?

00:08:05.670 --> 00:08:06.340
I guess.

00:08:06.340 --> 00:08:07.340
He said "I guess"!

00:08:07.340 --> 00:08:08.670
I heard him.

00:08:08.670 --> 00:08:12.010
Say, if this is for Zenjiro-san, are there
going to be a lot of performers there?

00:08:12.010 --> 00:08:13.680
Everyone from "Child's Toy" is coming.

00:08:13.680 --> 00:08:17.680
Will Tobita Mayu-chan or
Ayanohanamarukoji Tomomi-chan be there?

00:08:17.680 --> 00:08:19.680
You're all going to be
working together, right?

00:08:19.680 --> 00:08:21.350
Oh, I'm not too sure.

00:08:21.350 --> 00:08:23.020
Invite them, okay?

00:08:23.020 --> 00:08:25.690
Ah, mm-hmm. Right, I'll invite them!

00:08:25.690 --> 00:08:29.030
Um, Sana-chan, will you invite
Kamura Naozumi-kun, too?

00:08:29.030 --> 00:08:30.690
A- Aya-chan...

00:08:30.690 --> 00:08:33.990
Mm-hmm! I'll invite everyone over!

00:08:34.950 --> 00:08:38.330
Meanwhile, let's look in and see
how Tobita Mayu-chan is doing.

00:08:38.330 --> 00:08:39.620
What!?

00:08:39.660 --> 00:08:43.290
If that's the case, then we will have
to reconsider her appearing at all.

00:08:43.330 --> 00:08:46.630
I will get back to you
later with our answer.

00:08:46.630 --> 00:08:48.000
What's the matter?

00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:51.300
Good heavens, what was
that producer Tsu thinking?

00:08:51.300 --> 00:08:53.090
He said you'd be doing
both the song and the dance

00:08:53.090 --> 00:08:54.970
together with Sana-chan
and Tomomi-chan.

00:08:54.970 --> 00:08:56.340
I won't be doing a solo?

00:08:56.340 --> 00:08:59.010
So he says. Should we
give up these discussions?

00:08:59.010 --> 00:09:00.680
What about the
heroine role in the drama?

00:09:00.680 --> 00:09:03.680
He said they would like to decide that
at the meeting, and to please come.

00:09:03.680 --> 00:09:08.020
He must be joking. Why can't this
producer Tsu make an immediate decision?

00:09:08.020 --> 00:09:11.030
My word, to think that my Mayu-chan
would receive this treatment!

00:09:11.030 --> 00:09:12.690
Have they decided who the co-star is?

00:09:12.690 --> 00:09:15.700
Mm-hmm, he said they had
decided on Kamura Naozumi-kun.

00:09:15.700 --> 00:09:16.990
Kamura-san?

00:09:17.030 --> 00:09:19.370
Let's go, Mama! They're going to
decide who plays the heroine, right?

00:09:19.370 --> 00:09:20.330
Mayu-chan!

00:09:20.330 --> 00:09:22.040
I'm going to get the heroine role,
no matter what!

00:09:22.040 --> 00:09:25.710
No one but me is fit to co-star
with Kamura-san, after all.

00:09:25.710 --> 00:09:28.170
Her cheeks are starting to turn red.

00:09:29.040 --> 00:09:30.340
Sana-chan!

00:09:30.340 --> 00:09:31.960
Ah, Rei-kun. What's up?

00:09:31.960 --> 00:09:35.300
I know it's sudden, but there's
a meeting for the Shorokutai special.

00:09:35.300 --> 00:09:36.760
--Let's go.
--Nope.

00:09:36.760 --> 00:09:39.300
Tonight, I'm going shopping with
Aya-chan and the others for the party.

00:09:39.300 --> 00:09:43.310
Not this again. Sana-chan,
they can't start unless you're there.

00:09:43.310 --> 00:09:46.020
No way. It's not as though
we're doing rehearsals yet, right?

00:09:46.020 --> 00:09:46.980
You handle it, Rei-kun.

00:09:46.980 --> 00:09:48.980
Sana-chan, I'm begging you!

00:09:48.980 --> 00:09:50.310
Nope!

00:09:50.310 --> 00:09:50.980
Sana-chan!

00:09:50.980 --> 00:09:52.650
Must be tough, huh?

00:09:52.650 --> 00:09:55.320
Oh, yeah! They decided
on Kamura Naozumi-kun

00:09:55.320 --> 00:09:56.320
as the co-star for the drama.

00:09:56.320 --> 00:09:57.990
Oh, really? That will be fun.

00:09:57.990 --> 00:10:00.370
Really? That's right, I have
to give Naozumi-kun, Mayu-chan,

00:10:00.370 --> 00:10:01.660
and Tomomi-chan their invitations.

00:10:01.660 --> 00:10:02.990
I guess I will go, Rei-kun!

00:10:02.990 --> 00:10:03.990
Terrific!

00:10:03.990 --> 00:10:07.000
Let's wrap this up quickly!
I'm going shopping this evening!

00:10:07.000 --> 00:10:09.670
You're always putting work second.

00:10:09.670 --> 00:10:13.000
Nice to meet you. I'm Kamura.

00:10:13.000 --> 00:10:14.960
I'm Tobita Mayu.

00:10:17.010 --> 00:10:20.680
U- um...

00:10:20.680 --> 00:10:21.680
Sorry.

00:10:21.680 --> 00:10:24.680
Um, we once appeared in
the same production together.

00:10:24.680 --> 00:10:26.020
Is that right?

00:10:26.020 --> 00:10:28.730
Yes. We weren't in the
same scene with each other,

00:10:28.730 --> 00:10:30.020
but we did meet at rehearsal-

00:10:30.020 --> 00:10:31.270
Ah, Sana-chan!

00:10:31.270 --> 00:10:32.940
Yoo-hoo! Naozumi-kun, long time no see.

00:10:32.940 --> 00:10:35.280
You're as cheerful as ever,
huh Sana-chan?

00:10:35.280 --> 00:10:37.280
Mayu-chan, let's chat
about it later, okay?

00:10:37.280 --> 00:10:37.950
Sure!

00:10:37.950 --> 00:10:41.280
When I heard we'd be together on
this job, Sana-chan, I couldn't wait.

00:10:41.280 --> 00:10:45.290
Me, neither. Okay, actually, I just
heard about it a little while ago.

00:10:45.290 --> 00:10:48.620
But when I have good friends around,
it helps me to settle down.

00:10:48.620 --> 00:10:50.290
--That's just like you, Sana-chan.
--Those are what we call

00:10:50.290 --> 00:10:52.630
--Well, you are the one
with all those books.
--flames of envy, Tomomi-chan.

00:10:52.630 --> 00:10:58.970
"Envy"

00:10:52.630 --> 00:10:54.340
This is how it is written.

00:10:54.340 --> 00:10:56.300
In plain language,
we'd call it yakimochi ("jealousy").

00:10:56.300 --> 00:10:57.760
Oh, and sneaking of yakimochi
("toasted rice cakes"),

00:10:57.760 --> 00:10:58.970
there's this isobeyaki shop
in Shibuya that's-

00:10:58.970 --> 00:11:00.970
We don't need to hear about it.

00:11:00.970 --> 00:11:02.640
--Oh, here.
--What is it?

00:11:02.640 --> 00:11:04.970
An invitation to a birthday party
for Zenjiro-san.

00:11:04.970 --> 00:11:07.640
I know you must be busy, but if
you can, I'd like you to come.

00:11:07.640 --> 00:11:10.270
Oh, hey, I'd love for you
to come too, Mayu-chan.

00:11:10.310 --> 00:11:12.310
My classmates would
definitely like to meet you.

00:11:12.310 --> 00:11:13.650
Zenjiro? Who's that?

00:11:13.650 --> 00:11:15.650
Tomomi-chan, please come too!

00:11:15.650 --> 00:11:19.650
Thank you very much.
I will make sure to be there.

00:11:19.650 --> 00:11:21.320
Yeah? Really? Thanks!

00:11:21.320 --> 00:11:23.990
Sana-san, any party thrown
by you sounds like fun.

00:11:23.990 --> 00:11:27.330
I'm the producer, Tsu.
We're about to get started.

00:11:27.330 --> 00:11:30.000
Okay, Notsu-san, let's whiz through
this and finish it up quick!

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:33.000
It's not "Notsu," it's "Tsu."
Just plain "Tsu."

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:34.340
How ridiculous.

00:11:34.340 --> 00:11:38.420
Why should I have to be invited
to a gathering of common people?

00:11:44.680 --> 00:11:47.260
Uh-huh, judging by your face,

00:11:47.260 --> 00:11:48.680
you've assessed Sana-chan
and Mayu-chan's personalities,

00:11:48.680 --> 00:11:52.060
and it says that they are
completely incompatible, huh?

00:11:53.350 --> 00:11:55.810
I'll eat anything!

00:12:02.700 --> 00:12:14.040
"Drama Casting"

00:12:02.700 --> 00:12:07.700
So, about the drama's heroine...
I mean... do we make it Mayu-chan?

00:12:08.740 --> 00:12:10.700
Do we make it Sana-chan?

00:12:10.700 --> 00:12:14.040
--Well, for the longest time...
--Hey, I agreed to go shopping tonight.
Can I leave?

00:12:14.040 --> 00:12:14.710
No!

00:12:14.710 --> 00:12:17.710
What if Kurata-san were to play a dog?

00:12:17.710 --> 00:12:19.710
Great! Great! That's perfect!

00:12:19.710 --> 00:12:21.720
A dog?

00:12:21.720 --> 00:12:23.720
Yeah, that's okay! That sounds
like it would be funny! I'll do it!

00:12:23.720 --> 00:12:24.720
Sana-chan!

00:12:24.720 --> 00:12:28.720
Woof! Woof woof woof!

00:12:28.720 --> 00:12:29.720
What?

00:12:29.720 --> 00:12:31.680
She'll give her all to be a dog.

00:12:31.680 --> 00:12:34.020
We have another engagement,
so if you'll excuse us...

00:12:34.020 --> 00:12:38.020
What a sassy girl! Mayu-chan is
on a whole other level from her!

00:12:37.980 --> 00:12:40.190
"Shorokutai Special: New song,
'Vitamin Love' rehearsal"

00:12:38.020 --> 00:12:40.360
In any event,
the rehearsals have started.

00:12:40.360 --> 00:12:44.030
One-two, one-two,
lightly, lightly now...

00:12:44.030 --> 00:12:45.360
Nice, nice, good-

00:12:45.360 --> 00:12:47.030
No! No! Stop!

00:12:47.030 --> 00:12:48.030
Huh? No?

00:12:48.030 --> 00:12:50.040
Kurata-san! You've got both
the choreography and song wrong!

00:12:50.040 --> 00:12:51.370
Oh, she does?

00:12:51.370 --> 00:12:52.370
Sure enough...

00:12:52.370 --> 00:12:54.040
Would you take this more seriously?

00:12:54.040 --> 00:12:56.000
--If you can't keep
the pace up on your end,
--Whoa,

00:12:56.000 --> 00:12:58.710
--it's going to
embarrass us all, understand?
--she's strict.

00:12:58.710 --> 00:13:00.050
Just a touch of this...

00:13:00.050 --> 00:13:02.050
Is that Zenjiro-san?

00:13:02.050 --> 00:13:03.380
The doll?

00:13:03.380 --> 00:13:05.720
Oh, yes it is.
It's his birthday present.

00:13:05.720 --> 00:13:08.720
I'm not really very good at this sort
of thing, but I worked in a little gag.

00:13:08.720 --> 00:13:10.510
What kind?

00:13:12.060 --> 00:13:13.390
Wow, how fun!

00:13:13.390 --> 00:13:14.730
That was a goof up, you know.

00:13:14.730 --> 00:13:16.730
I told you not to fool around,
didn't it?

00:13:16.730 --> 00:13:18.400
I thought it would be okay,
since this is just a rehearsal.

00:13:18.400 --> 00:13:20.730
You've got no sense of seriousness!

00:13:20.730 --> 00:13:22.400
--If you keep on holding us back-
--She's made her angry again.

00:13:22.400 --> 00:13:23.740
Let's ease on ahead.

00:13:23.740 --> 00:13:26.070
Sana-chan, you look tired.

00:13:26.070 --> 00:13:27.740
Nah...

00:13:27.740 --> 00:13:29.410
Did you finish your handmade present?

00:13:29.410 --> 00:13:30.410
It's coming along slowly.

00:13:30.410 --> 00:13:31.410
Zing!

00:13:31.410 --> 00:13:33.660
Oh, where's the dog- Kurata-san?

00:13:33.660 --> 00:13:36.330
She was here standing
by just a moment ago.

00:13:36.330 --> 00:13:37.330
She's not here now, is she?

00:13:37.330 --> 00:13:39.000
Hey, good morning.

00:13:39.000 --> 00:13:40.340
--Good morning!
--Good morning!

00:13:40.340 --> 00:13:44.300
Um, I'm hoping we do well together
on today's drama rehearsal-

00:13:46.010 --> 00:13:47.680
I've done it again.

00:13:47.680 --> 00:13:49.010
You've done it, all right.

00:13:49.010 --> 00:13:50.680
Okay, "The drama rehearsal."

00:13:50.680 --> 00:13:54.680
This is a love-love comedy,
with Mayu-chan and Naozumi-kun.

00:13:54.680 --> 00:13:56.690
He is always sitting
there on that bench,

00:13:56.690 --> 00:14:00.020
wearing a sophisticated outfit
and reading manga...

00:14:00.020 --> 00:14:02.980
For some reason, every time
I pass by here as I walk my dog,

00:14:02.980 --> 00:14:04.360
he catches my fancy.

00:14:04.360 --> 00:14:05.360
Woof!

00:14:05.360 --> 00:14:10.030
What should I do? Maybe I should
try to talk to him. Right, Julie?

00:14:10.030 --> 00:14:11.030
Julie!

00:14:11.030 --> 00:14:11.700
Yuck!

00:14:11.700 --> 00:14:13.370
This isn't in the script!

00:14:13.370 --> 00:14:15.700
But I'm a dog, so-

00:14:15.700 --> 00:14:19.040
Oh, right, I'm a girl. Oops.
Oh dear, I'm standing up.

00:14:19.040 --> 00:14:20.710
I'm not supposed to talk, either, huh?

00:14:20.710 --> 00:14:21.710
I'm terribly sorry about this.

00:14:21.710 --> 00:14:23.380
Please go on ahead
with your love-love. Woof!

00:14:23.380 --> 00:14:26.380
That's funny, Sana-chan! Let's go
with that during the real thing!

00:14:26.380 --> 00:14:27.720
Are you sure?

00:14:27.720 --> 00:14:30.390
Okay, okay! I'm glad we
made you a dog, Sana-chan!

00:14:30.390 --> 00:14:31.720
Oh, she's mad, she's mad.

00:14:31.720 --> 00:14:34.310
And so, as Mayu-chan was
thus feeling aggravated,

00:14:34.350 --> 00:14:36.680
the taping of the
Shorokutai special went on,

00:14:36.680 --> 00:14:39.350
the explosion of Zenjiro dolls went on,

00:14:39.350 --> 00:14:41.690
Mayu-chan's twitching
got worse and worse,

00:14:41.690 --> 00:14:44.690
but she never forgot to act bashful
in front of Naozumi-kun.

00:14:44.690 --> 00:14:47.360
Mayu-chan, your throbbing
vein mark is still there!

00:14:47.360 --> 00:14:49.660
And thus, with the
Zenjiro dolls exploding,

00:14:49.660 --> 00:14:51.700
and the dog drawing attention
during the drama,

00:14:51.700 --> 00:14:55.370
the final day of shooting
arrived just like that!

00:14:55.370 --> 00:14:56.700
Um, Kamura-san...

00:14:56.700 --> 00:14:58.660
Ah, Mayu-chan, good morning.

00:14:58.660 --> 00:15:00.370
The last day is finally here, huh?

00:15:00.370 --> 00:15:01.330
Yeah.

00:15:01.330 --> 00:15:04.340
Um, if it's okay with you...

00:15:04.380 --> 00:15:08.380
...after the shooting is finished,
how about getting some dinner?

00:15:08.380 --> 00:15:13.350
Tonight is the party at
Sana-chan's house. Aren't you going?

00:15:14.390 --> 00:15:15.010
I...

00:15:15.010 --> 00:15:18.390
Done! I made it in time!
Zenjiro's doll!

00:15:18.390 --> 00:15:19.390
Huh? You two...

00:15:19.390 --> 00:15:21.350
Sana-chan, have you been there
the whole time!?

00:15:21.350 --> 00:15:22.060
Mm-hmm.

00:15:22.060 --> 00:15:24.730
Is that the doll
that was always exploding?

00:15:24.730 --> 00:15:27.030
That's right.

00:15:27.030 --> 00:15:29.400
After many explosions,
this is the finished product,

00:15:29.400 --> 00:15:31.360
with only a moderate burst!

00:15:31.360 --> 00:15:34.320
Now then, today is the last day, right?
I'll go get my dog costume!

00:15:34.320 --> 00:15:36.330
Kurata-san is always positively-

00:15:36.330 --> 00:15:38.330
-her own natural self, huh?

00:15:38.330 --> 00:15:43.330
She makes me so envious of her. If only
I could always be as forthright as her.

00:15:44.000 --> 00:15:47.550
"The drama's last scene"

00:15:44.330 --> 00:15:47.670
With Mayu-chan's level of aggravation
still up, it's the last of the shooting.

00:15:47.670 --> 00:15:49.670
I've been watching you the whole time.

00:15:49.670 --> 00:15:51.680
I've been watching you
the whole time, too.

00:15:51.680 --> 00:15:56.680
Woof, woof, woof! Woof, woof, woof!

00:15:59.020 --> 00:16:01.020
Flower blossom doggie!
Flower blossom dog-

00:16:01.020 --> 00:16:03.350
Shut up!!

00:16:03.350 --> 00:16:06.690
Okay, out! We'll use up to there.

00:16:06.690 --> 00:16:10.030
B- but why!?

00:16:10.030 --> 00:16:13.360
I've absolutely had it with this! I hate
the drama, the song, and everything!

00:16:13.360 --> 00:16:15.370
Right! Right! What kind
of program is this?

00:16:15.370 --> 00:16:16.370
They're making a fool of you!

00:16:16.370 --> 00:16:18.160
Mama, go ask them to retake everything

00:16:16.410 --> 00:16:19.370
"Tobita Mayu-sama
Ayanohanamarukoji Tomomi-sama"

00:16:18.160 --> 00:16:19.370
from the beginning.

00:16:19.370 --> 00:16:23.040
"Kurata Sana that way!"

00:16:19.370 --> 00:16:21.250
R- right! Right!
You're absolutely right!

00:16:21.290 --> 00:16:23.040
Okay, I'll go complain
to that producer, Tsu!

00:16:23.040 --> 00:16:26.380
Tsu, right? I'm sure
that producer's name was Tsu!

00:16:26.380 --> 00:16:28.250
All this time...

00:16:30.050 --> 00:16:33.300
All this time, I've been
working frantically.

00:16:33.300 --> 00:16:37.300
Ever since I was little, when all
the other children were playing,

00:16:37.300 --> 00:16:39.970
while I was reluctant to
even spend time going to school,

00:16:39.970 --> 00:16:43.980
the whole time, I've been
feverishly continuing my lessons.

00:16:43.980 --> 00:16:48.980
I have the ability. I got my current
popularity because of my ability.

00:16:50.650 --> 00:16:55.660
I'm not going to let that buffoon
from Komawari run circles around me!

00:16:56.320 --> 00:16:59.990
Um... begging your pardon
for a moment...

00:16:59.990 --> 00:17:00.990
It's me, Sana.

00:17:00.990 --> 00:17:03.120
Kurata-san?

00:17:04.670 --> 00:17:07.000
Oh no, you really are upset at me?

00:17:07.000 --> 00:17:09.460
Yeah, I just can't control
this power I have,

00:17:09.460 --> 00:17:11.670
and I guess it became
annoying for you, Mayu-chan.

00:17:11.670 --> 00:17:14.010
It's poses like that one
that I find most irritating.

00:17:14.010 --> 00:17:16.010
Whoa, that's harsh.

00:17:16.010 --> 00:17:17.550
No matter what I do,

00:17:17.550 --> 00:17:20.350
I'm as lousy at knowing where
to draw the line as I am at doing math.

00:17:20.350 --> 00:17:25.020
I have a bad habit of always enjoying
myself while working and everything else.

00:17:25.020 --> 00:17:28.810
So anyhow, um, about my party tonight...

00:17:29.690 --> 00:17:32.400
If it's okay with you, please come.

00:17:33.650 --> 00:17:36.320
Ah, you're angry...

00:17:36.320 --> 00:17:40.990
Mayu-chan, I'm crude, and get carried
away with myself, and thoughtless,

00:17:40.990 --> 00:17:43.000
and I think I probably
would be aggravating

00:17:43.000 --> 00:17:45.330
to a classical performer like yourself,

00:17:45.330 --> 00:17:49.630
but still, I had a lot of fun
in Shorokutai. Totally.

00:17:49.630 --> 00:17:54.630
After all, the three of us all
seem like different people!

00:17:54.670 --> 00:17:58.680
This little speech of mine
was insensitive, huh? Sorry, sorry...

00:17:58.680 --> 00:18:02.010
Please excuse me.

00:18:02.010 --> 00:18:04.020
So that's a "no" on the party?

00:18:04.020 --> 00:18:05.680
Well of course it is!

00:18:06.690 --> 00:18:08.850
--I'm terribly sorry to keep
bothering you like this!
--Over-the-hill cue ball!

00:18:08.850 --> 00:18:11.360
--This is so embarrassing!
--Over-the-hill cue ball!

00:18:18.700 --> 00:18:20.030
She's so silly.

00:18:20.030 --> 00:18:23.370
Uh, Mayu-san...

00:18:23.370 --> 00:18:25.700
S- sorry! Sorry.

00:18:25.700 --> 00:18:27.710
How long have you been here!?

00:18:27.710 --> 00:18:32.630
Um... The whole time, since before
you came in the room, Mayu-san.

00:18:32.630 --> 00:18:37.300
I- I didn't have time enough to leave.

00:18:37.300 --> 00:18:38.970
Um, Mayu-san,

00:18:38.970 --> 00:18:41.970
will you go together with me?
To Sana-san's party?

00:18:41.970 --> 00:18:44.970
That's what I was thinking when
I came here to wait for you, Mayu-san.

00:18:44.970 --> 00:18:45.640
No.

00:18:45.640 --> 00:18:46.980
Mayu-san...

00:18:46.980 --> 00:18:49.440
Mayu-san, you really
do want to go, don't you?

00:18:49.440 --> 00:18:51.980
You want to go, huh? Sure you do.

00:18:51.980 --> 00:18:53.980
Hold on! Don't decide for me!

00:18:53.980 --> 00:18:55.980
But you do, right?

00:18:55.980 --> 00:18:58.950
Wow, Tomomi-chan is a lot more
coercive than she looks, huh?

00:19:01.660 --> 00:19:05.330
That's Sana-san's handmade doll.

00:19:05.330 --> 00:19:09.330
She must have dropped it
earlier when she fell down.

00:19:09.330 --> 00:19:12.000
All right! Now you have
an excuse to go, don't you?

00:19:12.000 --> 00:19:13.340
How come!?

00:19:13.340 --> 00:19:14.670
"Zen-chan and Sane-yank hip hop act"

00:19:14.670 --> 00:19:16.340
--♪ Zen-chan... ♪
--♪ and Sane-yan's... ♪

00:19:16.340 --> 00:19:17.340
--♪ ...hip hop act! ♪

00:19:17.340 --> 00:19:19.340
♪ Sane-yan, been putting
too much weight on lately? ♪

00:19:19.340 --> 00:19:21.340
♪ What about you, Zen-chan,
your teeth stick out too far! ♪

00:19:21.340 --> 00:19:22.390
--♪ Chaka-poko, chaka-poko, ♪

00:19:22.390 --> 00:19:23.350
--♪ chaka-poko-rin ♪

00:19:23.350 --> 00:19:25.350
--♪ Sane-yan, your belly jiggles around. ♪
--What is this?

00:19:25.350 --> 00:19:26.350
--♪ Zen-chan, your sideburns curl around. ♪
--They're silly.

00:19:26.350 --> 00:19:28.640
--♪ Zen-chan, your sideburns curl around. ♪
--How can they dignify
putting on such a silly act?

00:19:28.640 --> 00:19:30.690
--♪ What kind of tasty work do you have? ♪
--Mother loves it! Let me join in!

00:19:30.690 --> 00:19:32.770
--♪ Got none, there ain't any, ♪
--So, Tobita Mayu-chan and Tomomi-chan

00:19:32.770 --> 00:19:33.310
--♪ don't even ask. ♪
--aren't coming after all?

00:19:33.310 --> 00:19:34.980
I guess not.

00:19:34.980 --> 00:19:37.280
But Kamura Naozumi-kun did come.

00:19:37.280 --> 00:19:39.950
Mm-hmm. Oh, is he planning
to play his trumpet next?

00:19:39.950 --> 00:19:41.990
♪ Would you let me join in with you! ♪

00:19:41.990 --> 00:19:43.990
♪ Oh, my! We are open to everyone! ♪

00:19:43.990 --> 00:19:46.280
♪ Now we're the middle-aged squad! ♪

00:19:46.280 --> 00:19:49.960
--♪ You're the only middle-aged one here! ♪

00:19:49.960 --> 00:19:51.210
--♪ Chaka-poko, chaka-poko, ♪

00:19:51.210 --> 00:19:52.000
--♪ chaka-poko-rin! ♪

00:19:52.000 --> 00:19:53.290
--♪ Chaka-poko, chaka-poko, ♪

00:19:53.290 --> 00:19:54.000
--♪ chaka-poko-rin! ♪

00:19:54.000 --> 00:19:55.290
Stop!

00:19:55.290 --> 00:19:56.670
--It's Mayu-chan!
--Tobita Mayu-chan!

00:19:56.670 --> 00:19:59.340
Tomomi-chan too, but less conspicuous!

00:19:59.340 --> 00:20:00.340
Mayu-chan...

00:20:00.340 --> 00:20:03.010
What kind of performance is that?
You're not out out to be pros.

00:20:03.050 --> 00:20:06.970
"Not out out to be a pro"

00:20:04.010 --> 00:20:05.680
--We are amateurs, you see...

00:20:05.680 --> 00:20:07.310
I'm a pro!

00:20:07.310 --> 00:20:10.680
Kurata-san, let's show them
how pros work.

00:20:10.680 --> 00:20:13.020
--Put this on.
--Sushi...

00:20:13.020 --> 00:20:14.020
--Mayu-chan...
--Come on, Zenjiro-chan.

00:20:14.020 --> 00:20:15.690
I'm a pro...

00:20:15.690 --> 00:20:19.570
Kurata-san, there is one thing
that you taught me.

00:20:19.900 --> 00:20:21.900
You always...

00:20:21.900 --> 00:20:25.240
smile so nicely.

00:20:25.240 --> 00:20:27.620
Hmph. Why do I have to do this?

00:20:30.580 --> 00:20:33.580
"Vitamin Love" Song by Shorokutai

00:20:40.920 --> 00:20:42.130
--♪ No, no, no, ♪

00:20:42.130 --> 00:20:47.140
--♪ those words are winning our hearts. ♪

00:20:47.600 --> 00:20:50.640
--♪ Maybe you're taking us lightly ♪

00:20:50.640 --> 00:20:53.270
--♪ by seeing us girls as girls. ♪

00:20:53.270 --> 00:20:56.690
--♪ lt takes a lot of vitamins ♪

00:20:56.690 --> 00:20:59.940
--♪ to be in love, ♪

00:20:59.940 --> 00:21:02.110
--♪ and if you get hurt, ♪

00:21:02.110 --> 00:21:05.860
--♪ that just means your alive. ♪

00:21:06.620 --> 00:21:08.660
--♪ Come on, pay attention, ♪

00:21:08.660 --> 00:21:10.290
--♪ my cool toy boys, ♪

00:21:10.290 --> 00:21:13.290
--♪ let your hearts throb. ♪

00:21:13.290 --> 00:21:15.170
--♪ You're posing too much, ♪

00:21:15.170 --> 00:21:16.960
--♪ my cool toy boys, ♪

00:21:16.960 --> 00:21:19.630
"Who's party is this, anyhow?"

00:21:16.960 --> 00:21:19.630
--♪ we're not children here. ♪

00:21:19.630 --> 00:21:21.210
--♪ If you don't ♪

00:21:21.210 --> 00:21:23.920
--♪ give our maiden charm its due, ♪

00:21:23.920 --> 00:21:27.220
--♪ sparkling love will never come to you. ♪

00:21:34.600 --> 00:21:37.940
For some reason, Mayu-chan looks
that much more brilliant.

00:21:37.940 --> 00:21:39.560
Is that Sana-chan's influence?

00:21:39.560 --> 00:21:41.940
Tomomi-chan, thank you! I'm so happy!

00:21:41.940 --> 00:21:42.940
Not at all...

00:21:42.940 --> 00:21:44.900
Mayu-chan, thank you, too!

00:21:44.900 --> 00:21:46.610
Kurata-san...

00:21:46.610 --> 00:21:48.570
You forgot something.

00:21:48.570 --> 00:21:53.250
I'm supposed to be the star today.
Right, Zenjiro?

00:21:53.250 --> 00:21:54.620
This.

00:21:54.620 --> 00:21:56.620
I- is that?

00:21:56.620 --> 00:22:00.290
This dolly that Sana-chan
gave me shua is cute.

00:22:00.290 --> 00:22:01.960
What is this!?

00:22:01.960 --> 00:22:04.630
That's a firecracker doll.
W- were you surprised?

00:22:04.630 --> 00:22:05.920
Yes, I was.

00:22:05.920 --> 00:22:06.930
Still, it's pretty, huh?

00:22:06.930 --> 00:22:09.590
Then, what is this?

00:22:09.590 --> 00:22:13.220
T- that's probably one
of my failed creations...

00:22:19.900 --> 00:22:22.900
Ooh... aah...

00:22:22.900 --> 00:22:25.240
Kurata-san!

00:22:25.240 --> 00:22:27.570
Oh, I've done it again.

00:22:27.570 --> 00:22:29.910
I'm partially responsible, too.

00:22:29.910 --> 00:22:34.330
Once again, shall we...
sing like this!?

00:22:40.750 --> 00:22:42.250
"Back against the wall."

00:22:42.750 --> 00:22:47.760
That's what you say about times like these.

00:22:49.010 --> 00:22:52.510
In dire straits,

00:22:53.260 --> 00:22:56.100
I've been waiting for an answer.

00:22:56.600 --> 00:22:59.980
My confessions are worked out
long in advance,

00:23:00.940 --> 00:23:05.070
to always go along with the scenario.

00:23:05.280 --> 00:23:11.110
My heart may be settled, but my mind is in a...

00:23:11.320 --> 00:23:13.280
...panic!!

00:23:14.280 --> 00:23:19.120
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:19.330 --> 00:23:21.830
he's there.

00:23:22.750 --> 00:23:25.090
And our usual classroom...

00:23:25.300 --> 00:23:27.710
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:23:27.800 --> 00:23:30.220
...for two.

00:23:31.050 --> 00:23:33.680
Although I've said nothing but wisecracks...

00:23:33.890 --> 00:23:38.430
...up to now, just for today,

00:23:39.350 --> 00:23:42.020
I'm going to be honest and sincere,

00:23:42.230 --> 00:23:46.730
so BOY, take a look my way!

00:23:47.650 --> 00:23:52.320
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:52.490 --> 00:23:54.990
he's there,

00:23:55.910 --> 00:23:58.120
And our usual classroom...

00:23:58.410 --> 00:24:00.750
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:24:00.870 --> 00:24:03.250
...for two.

00:24:06.750 --> 00:24:09.420
Hoy! In Sana-chan's next adventures...

00:24:09.420 --> 00:24:11.880
A crisis comes up for 6th Year 3rd Class'
only love-love couple,

00:24:11.880 --> 00:24:13.760
Aya-chan and Tsuyoshi-kun.

00:24:13.760 --> 00:24:16.760
Tsuyoshi-kun's heart starts pounding
after a lovely present arrives for him.

00:24:16.760 --> 00:24:18.770
Who was it that sent him the present?

00:24:18.770 --> 00:24:23.060
Tsuyoshi-kun's heart wavers. He has
a weakness for presents, you know.

00:24:23.060 --> 00:24:25.400
Next time on Kodomo no Omocha,
Episode 35;

00:24:25.400 --> 00:24:27.730
The Confrontation Between
Presents and Aya-chan's Love,

00:24:27.730 --> 00:24:31.400
There Is a Reason For These Presents

00:24:31.400 --> 00:24:34.990
It's starting to get chillier.
Please take care not to catch cold.
